{"input_text": "Question: How do you calculate the following sum?  
 \begin{equation*}
\sum_{i=k}^n i
\end{equation*} 

Answer: $\sum_{i=k}^n i = \sum_{i=0}^n i - \sum_{i=0}^{k-1} i = \frac{1}{2} \left[ n(n+1)  - (k-1)k \right]$ 
